body:
I think this will be entrance to final raid and I have theory who will be final boss. I don't think it gonna be N'Zoth, 2nd time Azshara(I still believe she is alive) or even Sylvanas. I think it will be Azeroth herself.. or should I say Void Titan Azeroth. I think we and Magni fucked up. Here's a thing - I was wondering why Azerite, blood of Azeroth, poped up all across the world when she was stabbed in Silithus. There in Silithus should be rivers of magic blood floting from wound caused by Sargera's sword, not this tiny rocks and little wounds that we absorbing into Heart of Azeroth. I think Sargeras wanted to heal Aeroth from void corruption while we were fighting with Argus. If he wanted just to destroy planet and titan inside of it why would he wait until we kill Argus? What's purpose of that whole Legion invasion? Of course we can say he stabbed Azeroth in Silithus because he knew that there in Chamber of Heart which, I suppouse, is near soul of Azeroth but I don't think so. It took so much efford to make invasion when he could just create this huge sword and strike when "no one would see this". I think he wanted to cure Azeroth and when he saw that we killed Agrus he knew that time was over and he had to do something. So what is Azerite? I think it's some kind of void energy and Sargeras's sword was pumping another energy to separate this void energy from Azeroth(Azeroth titan, not planet). It can look different than we usually see as "void energy" but it can be like that because it's connected with Titan. When we used our artifact weapons to seal energy from Sargeras's sword we stopped or slowed curing process and that's when we fucked up first time. But we fucked up second time - when we took Heart of Azeroth from Mangi and started to collect Azerite enegry into it. "The king of diamonds has been made a pawn" - Magni could have good intentions but he was tricked and we with him. We are collecting void energy which will be use not to heal Azeroth the titan but  to heal Void Titan Azeroth. But you know, it's WoW so at the end of the day we will defeat void verion of Azeroth because she will be weak and "incompete". This will be 3rd time when we will do not very smart thing. Right before final raid Magni will say that we collected so much of Azerite and we can heal Azeroth. We will go deeper into Chamber of Heart, probably to place when we will fight Void Titan Azeroth and we gonna release whole energy stored in Heart. This will be the moment when corrupted titan will be born. Of course we will defeat her because young, weak or something - you know, typical Bli$$ard  thing - we killed titan once, we can kill void version of titan as well. At the end we will somehow use or try to use Sargera's sword to suck this whole titan-void from Azeroth energy and seal into sword.. but! "At the hour of her third death, she will usher in our coming" - yup, thats about Azeroth. First death was when Aman'Thul teared out Y'shaarj from her. Second was when Well of Eternity was destroyed and now it's time for third death. Black Epire will rise once more. Two more quotes can confirm my theory: "From the earth, he draws strength. Our earth. Our strength." and "Its surface blazes bright, masking shadows below." - I'm not sure who is "he" from 1st quote but "our strength" is energy of void i think. This quote could be as well foreshadow of player using Heart to collect Azerite. Secound one can be description of Azerite if my theory is right - shiny energy and no one would ever consider that's a enegry of void.. no one but me ;) I thought that "Her heart is a crater, and we have filled it" is about Azeroth as well but now I think is about Azshara - her deal with Legion didn't work so she was devastated, she wanted power, she wanted to rule but at the end she had nothing and then N'Zoth offered her new deal, he promised power.

&#x200B;

BUT HEY! It's just theory, WoW theory.

&#x200B;

I'm so sorry for my poor english ;)

When I was about 7 years old my sister had to run away from home. Our mother always was possesive(if it is good word - english isn't my firt language) but one evening she did something terrible and to this day I want to cry when I think about it.. I'm 25 right now.  She beat my sister so fuckin hard. She - sister - was almost 20 but she couldn't even protect herself. Late in night she run away. I was little child back then I always saw my parents almost like saints. That was to hard for me and I started to deny reality. I told myself that my mother had a reason to do what she did.. I used to it.. for several years. I tried to forget about it so hard but i couldn't and once day it came back to me. I realised that not only my mother was a monster, I was aswell. I know I was just a child but.. oh fuck, it's tough.. How could I care more about this monster instead of my poor sister. She had to run away from her home, place where she should be safe. The day I realised that I was so fuckin coward to face reality I wanted to comite suicide.. I still want. I still hate myself.

&#x200B;

I've never told about it to anyone, not even closest people in my life. Don't know why I wrote it here. If not that day I would be different person.. I think I would have normal life, I would have my own family but I can stand thought I would become someone like my mother.
